    {
      "tr": "Toplam oran `sum(buy_b) / sum(n_b)`.",
      "en": "The total rate is `sum(buy_b) / sum(n_b)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "İki toplam oranı karşılaştır.",
      "en": "Compare the two total rates."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef simpson_flags(buy_a, n_a, buy_b, n_b):\n    pairs = zip(buy_a, n_a, buy_b, n_b)\n    every = all(bb / nb > ba / na for ba, na, bb, nb in pairs)\n    pooled = sum(buy_b) / sum(n_b) > sum(buy_a) / sum(n_a)\n    return [every, pooled]\n\n\nprint(simpson_flags([180, 50], [1500, 1000], [22, 52], [170, 1000]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef simpson_flags(buy_a, n_a, buy_b, n_b):\n    pairs = zip(buy_a, n_a, buy_b, n_b)\n    every = all(bb / nb > ba / na for ba, na, bb, nb in pairs)\n    pooled = sum(buy_b) / sum(n_b) > sum(buy_a) / sum(n_a)\n    return [every, pooled]\n\n\nprint(simpson_flags([180, 50], [1500, 1000], [22, 52], [170, 1000]))\n```"
    }
